  "dur": 15.168,
  "speaker": "Lorekeeper Aldous",
  "text": "Before the Chrono-Rifts tore open the northern sky, Ashenvale Bastion stood as the serene frontier of Sunsteel knights and woodland trackers. Now, medieval stone and alien monoliths share one horizon."
